{
  "slug": "lovable",
  "name": "Lovable",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Build, iterate on, deploy, and manage Lovable apps from Claude Code. Bundles the official Lovable MCP server (remote, OAuth 2.1) and adds focused commands for the common build/iterate/database workflows, with credit- and publish-safety prompts.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **3 commands** and **1 MCP server**.\n\n- **Commands** (3): `build` (Build a new Lovable app from a prompt and optionally deploy it), `db` (Provision or query a Lovable project's Cloud (Postgres) database), `iterate` (Send a change request to a Lovable project's agent and review the diff)\n- **MCP servers** (1): `lovable`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install lovable@claude-plugins-official` from `lovablelabs/mcp`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
